OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wed 19 Aug to Fri 28 Aug
OL,6,FThe first few days of this period are
OL,7,Flikely to be rather changeable, with
OL,8,Fmany parts of the UK seeing showers or
OL,9,Fperhaps some longer spells of rain.
OL,10,FWithin this broad pattern, there is
OL,11,Fpotential for a low pressure system to
OL,12,Fdevelop just to the west or possibly
OL,13,Fover the UK, which would bring the
OL,14,Fpossibility more widespread rain and
OL,15,Fperhaps strong winds. By the latter
OL,16,Fpart of August, there are signals for
OL,17,Fhigh pressure to become rather more
OL,18,Fdominant again, with more in the way
OL,19,Fof dry weather developing once more,
OL,20,Fespecially towards parts of the north
OL,21,Fand west. Temperatures are more likely
OL,22,Fto be above normal than below overall,
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fthough the possibility of widespread
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,For exceptional heat is perhaps a
OL,25,Flittle lower than in recent weeks.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
